Error [E0387]: Checked text raw construction requires an audited `#Unsafe` region
  --> checked_text_raw_requires_unsafe.jet:21:20
    |
 21 |     token :: Token.raw("unchecked")
    |                    ^^^
 Why: `Type.raw(text)` bypasses the declared CheckedText checker and is an expert-only escape
 Fix: Wrap the call in `#Unsafe("reason") { … }`, or use `Type.from(text)` for validation
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0387
